      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would appreciate an update on the expected timeline for this feature, as well as any details on the current challenges or considerations that are affecting its release.\n\nThis post was made 5 years ago, and has been marked as tracked.\n\nWe are seeing a slow rollout of changes made to the Community Guidelines (See attachment), but there needs to be a way that users can report accounts suspected of being underaged in the VRChat platform via the in app moderation tools.\n\nI am asking for VRChat to please provide an update to this feature request either via the reply to this Canny, or via the Developer Update patch notes.\n\nThis is something that the community clearly cares a lot about, and I speak for myself when I say that I want more transparency so I can feel safer knowing my mature conversations with friends stay far away from minors.\n\nAge verification was a good first step, now we need in game reporting tools incase someone is account sharing, or bypassing identification in some way.\n\nMost forget that each kid has different circumstances, and a parent may not be in the picture.\n\nIts important to remember that, and try and keep kids out of mature spaces.\n\nBe an advocate. Speak up, because change starts with action, even if its annoying to do.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
